    "created_at": "2021-07-03T18:45:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-03T18:53:06Z",
    "body": "Nevermind. This isn't a bug.\r\n\r\nThe issue is that you are doing the formatting in the `format` variable. This needs to be done in the format variable for the `git_branch` module. Basically, replace:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n- format = \"\"\"\r\n- [╭──](bold gray)[⟰](bold green) $directory [(<$git_branch$git_status>)](bold yellow) [$status](bold red)\r\n- [╰─](bold gray)$character\"\"\"\r\n+ format = \"\"\"\r\n+ [╭──](bold gray)[⟰](bold green) $directory $git_branch$git_status [$status](bold red)\r\n+ [╰─](bold gray)$character\"\"\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd then add:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n- [git_branch]\r\n- format=\"$branch\"\r\n+ [git_branch]\r\n+ format=\"[(<$branch)](bold yellow)\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n.. last but not least:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n[git_status]\r\n- format=\"$modified\"\r\n+ format=\"[($modified>)](bold yellow)\"\r\nmodified=\"*\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nLet me know if the issue persists, or if this doesn't fix it.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
